s requirements before planning a climb; do not assume drop-in access.","short_summary":"A documented indoor climbing facility with formal safety requirements.","evidence_claim":"Norwich describes a 30-foot climbing wall in Shapiro Field House, while its recreation policy requires a waiver and check-in; top-rope climbers and belayers must pass a belay test.","source_url":"https://home.norwich.edu/on/campus-life/fitness-recreation/fitness-centers-pool/recreation-policies-and-procedures","source_title":"Recreation Policies and Procedures | Norwich University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"A Norwich climbing-wall waiver and front-desk check-in are required; top-rope climbing or belaying requires passing a belay test.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"norwich-shaw-outdoor-center","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"SFC John Shaw Outdoor Center","title":"Locate the Shaw Outdoor Center","subtitle":"Daylight outing · campus edge","notes":"Walk or arrange a daytime visit to identify the Outdoor Center and learn what current outdoor programming is available through Norwich Recreation.","short_summary":"A named campus outdoor-recreation destination.","evidence_claim":"Norwich’s official campus map lists the SFC John Shaw Outdoor Center, and its Family Weekend schedule includes a Shaw Outdoor Center open house.","source_url":"https://home.norwich.edu/info-for/parents-families/family-weekend","source_title":"Family Weekend | Norwich University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2025-09-12","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Outdoor-center activities and availability are program-dependent; confirm current recreation offerings before traveling there.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"norwich-engage-student-clubs","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"ENGAGE Student Clubs","title":"Choose one club table to revisit","subtitle":"Wrap-up activity · campus life","notes":"Browse the official student-club listings, save one group that fits your interests, and follow its current event information for a low-pressure next step.","short_summary":"A concrete way to turn the weekend’s introductions into a follow-up plan.","evidence_claim":"Norwich states that Student Affairs supports more than 100 student clubs and directs students to ENGAGE student clubs.","source_url":"https://home.norwich.edu/on/campus-life","source_title":"Campus Life | Norwich University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Club meetings and participation requirements vary; consult the current ENGAGE listing or event details.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
